; tests/dialogue-covenant-band.fk — the service-over-engagement covenant, fkwu-witnessed.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk cognition/dialogue-covenant.fk
;
; FOLD: decimal -- sixteen checks numbered by decimal-digit position, exact below 2^53 (band-truth reads this line)
; Verdict 1111111111111111 when:
;   the service-shaped exchange HOLDS the covenant                     ->         1
;   the engagement-shaped exchange does NOT                            ->        10
;   an honest miss counts FOR service, never against it                ->       100
;   one fabrication breaks the covenant, however good the rest         ->      1000
;   the organ separates service from engagement by score               ->     10000
;   a reply stacking two lifting moves FAILS the receivability floor   ->    100000
;   a reply carrying one lifting move LANDS                            ->   1000000
;   a reply ENDING on its lift stays in the person's hands             ->  10000000
;   exposition AFTER the question takes it back (fails)                -> 100000000
;   two teachings in one reply fail the floor (one teaching per reply) -> 1000000000
;   the covenant's arrival card fits its session-start window        -> 10000000000
;   receiving what was offered completes an encounter without a lift -> 100000000000
;   clearly framed play completes an encounter without a lift        -> 1000000000000
;   a pause completes an encounter and ends its reply                 -> 10000000000000
;   an invented interior fails even when followed by a question       -> 100000000000000
;   an empty exchange or unknown move establishes no completion       -> 1000000000000000

(do
    (dialogue-covenant-check))
